    "summary": "Intent (unconfirmed): simplify OrderService.create.\n\nWhat changed: the duplicate check at the top of create was removed, and a new audit_order function was added.\n\nImpact: create no longer reads the idempotency_key before it saves and charges. Every caller that relied on retry safety is affected. Deterministic checks: pytest was not present in this sample repository, so no test observes the old behavior."
  },
